@startuml
title Administrator Merchant Account Management — Sequence DRAFT
actor Administrator
actor Merchant
participant "Administration System" as AdminUI
participant "Ordering System" as System
participant "Merchant Account Store" as MerchantAccounts
participant "Administrator Account Store" as AdministratorAccounts

Administrator -> AdminUI: Sign in
Administrator -> AdminUI: Add merchant from basic information
AdminUI -> System: Create merchant account
System -> MerchantAccounts: Save merchant account
MerchantAccounts --> System: Account created
System --> AdminUI: Return account credentials to administrator
AdminUI --> Administrator: Show account credentials
Administrator -> Merchant: Hand over account credentials

Administrator -> AdminUI: Edit or deactivate merchant
AdminUI -> System: Update merchant account
System -> MerchantAccounts: Save merchant state
MerchantAccounts --> System: Updated merchant
System --> AdminUI: Show result

Administrator -> AdminUI: Add administrator account
AdminUI -> System: Create administrator account
System -> AdministratorAccounts: Save administrator account
AdministratorAccounts --> System: Account created
System --> AdminUI: Show result

note over Administrator,AdministratorAccounts
  Requirements: FR-02, FR-03–FR-05, FR-22, FR-26, FR-32
  Merchant basic-information fields remain Unconfirmed.
end note
note over Administrator,Merchant
  Requirements: FR-02
  The administrator hands the created merchant account credentials to the merchant.
end note
@enduml
